Package: gstIndia
Title: India State-Wise Monthly GST Collection Data (2017-2026)
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Pawan", 
           email = "pawanjangra1198@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: Provides tidy, analysis-ready datasets of India's Goods and 
    Services Tax (GST) collections from July 2017 through early 2026, sourced 
    from official Government of India Ministry of Finance data. Includes 
    state-wise monthly domestic GST broken down by component (CGST, SGST, IGST, 
    CESS) across all Indian states and Union Territories, as well as All-India 
    summary aggregates. Helper functions support filtering, year-on-year growth 
    analysis, and state/component summaries.
